    correctIndex: 1,
    explanationVi: "\u5272\u5F15\u5238 (phi\u1EBFu gi\u1EA3m gi\xE1) nh\u1EB1m m\u1EE5c \u0111\xEDch khuy\u1EBFn kh\xEDch kh\xE1ch QUAY L\u1EA0I l\u1EA7n sau, n\xEAn ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u01B0a l\xFAc thanh to\xE1n (\u0111\u1EC3 d\xF9ng cho l\u1EA7n sau). N\u1EBFu \u0111\u01B0a ngay l\xFAc kh\xE1ch v\xE0o qu\xE1n th\xEC ch\u1EC9 l\xE0 gi\u1EA3m gi\xE1 \u0111\u01A1n thu\u1EA7n cho l\u01B0\u1EE3t n\xE0y, l\xE0m gi\u1EA3m doanh thu.",
