    questionVi: "S\u1ED1 lo\u1EA1i rau l\u01B0u th\xF4ng tr\xEAn th\u1ECB tr\u01B0\u1EDDng Nh\u1EADt B\u1EA3n hi\u1EC7n nay v\xE0o kho\u1EA3ng bao nhi\xEAu?",
