    correctIndex: 1,
    explanationVi: "Khi kh\xE1ch khi\u1EBFu n\u1EA1i v\u1ECB m\xF3n \u0103n c\xF3 v\u1EA5n \u0111\u1EC1, ph\u1EA3i t\u1EF1 m\xECnh ki\u1EC3m tra v\u1ECB v\xE0 h\u1ECFi l\u1EA1i quy tr\xECnh ch\u1EBF bi\u1EBFn v\u1EDBi nh\xE2n vi\xEAn \u0111\xE3 l\xE0m m\xF3n \u0111\xF3.",
