    scenarioVi: 'N\u0103m ngo\xE1i qu\xE1n \u0111\xE3 di\u1EC5n t\u1EADp s\u01A1 t\xE1n 1 l\u1EA7n. Qu\u1EA3n l\xFD n\xF3i "gi\u1ED1ng nh\u01B0 di\u1EC7t c\xF4n tr\xF9ng, l\xE0m 2 l\u1EA7n/n\u0103m l\xE0 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c".',
