    scenarioVi: 'Trong m\xF3n \u0103n c\u1EE7a kh\xE1ch ph\xE1t hi\u1EC7n c\xF3 s\u1EE3i l\xF4ng gi\u1ED1ng l\xF4ng mi, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i t\xF3c. Nh\xE2n vi\xEAn m\u1EDBi ngh\u0129 "v\xEC kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i t\xF3c n\xEAn kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n \u0111i\u1EC1u tra g\xEC, ch\u1EC9 c\u1EA7n l\xE0m l\u1EA1i m\xF3n l\xE0 \u0111\u1EE7".',
    questionJa: "\u3053\u306E\u8003\u3048\u306F\u9069\u5207\u304B\u3002",
