    sentenceVi: 'T\xE1c nh\xE2n g\xE2y ng\u1ED9 \u0111\u1ED9c n\xE0o KH\xD4NG t\u1EF1 sinh s\xF4i trong th\u1EF1c ph\u1EA9m, khi\u1EBFn nguy\xEAn t\u1EAFc "kh\xF4ng \u0111\u1EC3 sinh s\xF4i" kh\xF4ng \xE1p d\u1EE5ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c cho n\xF3?',
