    sentenceVi: "Trong b\u1EBFp, ph\u1EA7n l\xF5i th\u1EF1c ph\u1EA9m ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u1EA1t nhi\u1EC7t \u0111\u1ED9 t\u1ED1i thi\u1EC3u bao nhi\xEAu \xB0C, trong \xEDt nh\u1EA5t 1 ph\xFAt (ri\xEAng th\u1EF1c ph\u1EA9m nghi nhi\u1EC5m Norovirus l\xE0 85-90\xB0C trong \xEDt nh\u1EA5t 90 gi\xE2y)?",
